{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Devour the Living!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.poster.avif?t=1760268639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.webm?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.mp4?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overlord\u2019s Harvest is an incremental action game where you play as a demon lord harvesting souls from humans, dwarves, and elves.\u00a0Move across the battlefield, unleash endless spells, and collect souls to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Embrace the Darkness!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.poster.avif?t=1760268639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.webm?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.mp4?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your harvested souls to unlock new talents. Each upgrade permanently strengthens your demonic power, letting you harvest faster and dominate harder with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Forge in Souls!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.poster.avif?t=1760268639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.webm?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.mp4?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge strength through souls. Pour your harvest into weapon upgrades that permanently boost your attack power, letting you cut down enemies faster with each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Rule the Abyss!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.poster.avif?t=1760268639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.webm?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.mp4?t=1760268639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your throne between harvests. Command your loyal servants, gaze upon your growing army, and prepare for the next wave of slaughter in your quest for dominance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035610?t=1760268639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/d278a66fc6ae469dc95a3f862b259c81dceb914c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760268639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams